## Failure classification evidence

- The full matrix passed all-AutoByteus, all-Codex, all-Claude, mixed AutoByteus+Codex, and nested mixed AutoByteus+Codex+Claude suites.
- The only failure was `tests/e2e/runtime/mixed-task-delegation.e2e.test.ts` while waiting for `Team Communication revision feedback to concrete task-agent run`.
- The test had not called `accept_task` yet; revision feedback is sent immediately after the initial task-agent completion report is observed.
- The failure preview shows the coordinator tool turn reporting that the `target_agent_run_id` is no longer reachable before acceptance.
- This violates the accepted exact-run task-agent lifecycle: concrete task-agent runs must remain active/recoverable targets for feedback until the delegator accepts the task; `accept_task` is the terminal transition.

